  (text "Board B: receives the switch SerDes S0/S1 over the high-speed mezzanine. PHY analog rails filtered locally."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 23.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "936c2349-095a-5139-b14a-99fcad453ed3"))
  (text "X-29 reset: ETH_PHY_RST_N = TPS3808G33(V3V3_PHY, MR=EXP_PHY_RST_N) AND TPS3808G01(V0V95_PHY); 126 ms typ / 68 ms min after the LAST rail is valid (needs >= 10 ms)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1a5ee106-9597-5902-b404-055d869c1377"))
  (text "X-30 router domain V3V3_RTR_M: every pull-up the module sees (reset, recovery, MDC/MDIO, SW_INT) is on V3V3_RTR_M. MDC/MDIO/SW_INT cross to the switch through 2N7002 pass FETs (gate = V3V3_RTR_M): router off -> FETs off, the body diodes are reverse-biased by the switch-side pull-ups, nothing reaches the dead module. Router on with ETH off is prevented in hardware (TPS3808 interlock on EXP_EN_RTR, board A). SerDes are AC-coupled."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 30.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "1d36c61f-b094-51a4-9d0b-9c09381ad0e2"))
